# oracle: pair dpd with its random force on, 30 atoms in a 3d box smaller than the neighbor cutoff (ghosts from several periodic images per dimension)
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): engine vs native max error 3.3e-15 (thermo), 3.6e-14 (per-atom), scale max(1,|x|). Random force ON (T=1), box 1.2 smaller than the cutoff plus skin (ghosts from several periodic images per dimension).
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-12 abs=0
units        lj
boundary     p p p
atom_style   atomic
dimension    3
newton       on
comm_modify  vel yes
region       simBox block 0 1.2 0 1.2 0 1.2
create_box   1 simBox
create_atoms 1 random 30 4321 simBox
mass         * 1.0
pair_style   dpd 1.0 1.0 3854262
pair_coeff   * * 25.0 4.5
timestep     0.01
run_style    verlet
velocity all create 1.0 68768932
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo       10
fix 1 all    nve
run          50
